    {
        "Id": 21,
        "ActionId": 21,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "It is not like her to follow orders. Noticing that, No. 21 does not question any further. Noctis, grumpy as he is, also detects it and remains silent. For once, the three are in sync in the face of the unknown."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 22,
        "ActionId": 22,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Constructs in black and more black-clad agents depart the landing transport crafts, setting up quarantine zones, disinfection chambers, laboratories, and temporary accommodations."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 23,
        "ActionId": 23,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "They announce the end of your mission. \"Finding Luna\" seems to have disappeared into thin air from the mission logs, and the men in black are now surrounding the area, trying to track down Vonnegut."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 24,
        "ActionId": 24,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Cerberus, in turn, is surrounded by the Kurono agents, being questioned on the information of the new enemy."
