    },
    {
        "Id": 161,
        "ActionId": 164,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "You stand tall, and vertigo hits you hard. You often feel this way after long flights or remote connections—your back, the freshly healed ribs, your temples... every part of your body is in pain."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 162,
        "ActionId": 165,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "You gently stretch your limbs and take the opportunity to look around the room again."
