    },
    {
        "Id": 166,
        "ActionId": 169,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "A Construct walks up and points his gun at you, his grunting voice coming out of a speaker in the corner of the room. His footsteps are so heavy from all the gear he is wearing that the ground shakes again."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 167,
        "ActionId": 170,
        "Type": 302,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "...Whatever you say, boss.",
            171,
