    },
    {
        "Id": 168,
        "ActionId": 171,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "You sit back down and rest your head on your hands. You want to ask about Kurono's plan for you after this, but it is evidently futile, considering the faceless, armed figures standing before you."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 169,
        "ActionId": 172,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "In this brief moment of respite, the gears in your brain start turning."
