        "Id": 174,
        "ActionId": 177,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Kurono seems to know everything about you."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 175,
        "ActionId": 178,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "If they compare the visual data during a connection, Kurono can easily deduce that you might have been \"stained\" by Luna's memories somehow."
