    },
    {
        "Id": 178,
        "ActionId": 181,
        "NextActionId": 183,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "No... Even if you have indeed imported her memories, it is still impossible to extract a Construct's memory from a human brain."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 179,
        "ActionId": 182,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "They are ambitious, that is for sure."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 180,
        "ActionId": 183,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "You still have so many questions regarding this operation. The Ascendant that has been guiding Roland... was it an accident that she ran into Cerberus? Vera knows more than she has been letting on."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 181,
        "ActionId": 184,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Did Luna really go there after that battle? Then who was fighting her? Ever since you entered the town, those hallucinations became clearer and clearer. What is the connection between them?"
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 182,
        "ActionId": 185,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Countless questions occupy your mind. At the very least, the most important one is answered."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 183,
        "ActionId": 186,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Tiredness overcomes you."
